WEBVTT

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.330
"Episode 12: Decision"

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.500
"Hokuto Hidaka"
"1 Message"

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:53.830
♪ A dramatic night that
may leave you breathless ♪

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:54.870
--♪ Dance ♪
--♪ Live! ♪

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.830
--♪ Shout ♪
--♪ UNDEAD! ♪

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:02.330
♪ You'll keep falling, Melody in the Dark ♪

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.120
♪ Overflowing ♪

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.410
♪ Played on the music staff in the heavens ♪

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:37.750
♪ A sacred tune ♪

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.120
--♪ The song ♪
--♪ that flutters down ♪

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.620
--♪ Is the melody ♪
--♪ of a dream ♪

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.750
♪ Its pure harmony ♪

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.290
--♪ Tells of the end ♪
--♪ of the darkness ♪

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:51.950
♪ The unending symphony ♪

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.700
"To Hokuto"

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:28.410
♪ I can't wait because
the cheers are calling me ♪

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:34.540
♪ Raise the curtain!
LET'S CLAP YOUR HEART BEAT ♪

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:52.370
♪ What kinds of dreams
will bloom here on the stage? ♪

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:56.540
♪ We're all free to do what we want ♪

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:03.040
♪ But if we're going to move forward
toward a faraway goal ♪

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.410
♪ Then we can even ♪

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:08.120
♪ Reach that star together! ♪

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.910
♪ I've been chasing hope for so long ♪

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.870
♪ And I've finally gotten it ♪

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:18.080
♪ I'm talking about... my friends ♪

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.580
♪ Yes! We are teammates! ♪

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.870
♪ You can say what you really think ♪

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.250
♪ Just be yourself! ♪

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:29.580
♪ We can understand each other's feelings
through exchanging glances ♪

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:35.040
♪ Come, the spotlight changes
our sweat into light ♪

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:40.370
♪ It's a special time, so let's have fun
with everything we've got! ♪

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:45.750
♪ We'll give you all the more excitement
for making you wait ♪

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:52.040
♪ The curtains are up!
LET'S CLAP YOUR HEART BEAT ♪

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.120
"Official Rules"

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:20.080
"Overtime Match"

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:40.790
♪ I wanted to shine, like the stars in the sky ♪

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:46.750
♪ The dream I've had so long
is within reach on this STAGE! ♪

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:56.160
♪ I believe in a bright future of STARS ♪

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:01.620
♪ We've gathered together
like we're playing the same song ♪

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:06.450
♪ We'll run to our destination ♪

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:12.450
♪ With road bumps and laughter along
the way... isn't that how youth works? ♪

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.370
♪ (HARMONY) ♪

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.000
♪ We connect ♪

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.620
♪ (We'll become an ENSEMBLE) ♪

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:22.250
♪ Me meeting you has to have
been the START LINE ♪

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:28.540
♪ I'm shining now, the MELODY pours forth
with my heart keeping the beat ♪

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.620
♪ Can't stop these frenzied feelings now... ♪

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:32.620
♪ Come here ♪

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:38.870
♪ You can ask for more, yeah,
it's better when more thoughts unite ♪

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:45.080
♪ On this STAGE where
we're like a constellation ♪

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:56.830
♪ You can ask for more, yeah,
our thoughts keep uniting ♪

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:02.540
♪ On this STAGE where
we're like a constellation ♪

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:09.500
♪ Let's bring our dreams to life,
I want to make them come true with you! ♪

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:17.000
<i>Open the invitation</i>

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.040
<i>It's a door summoning eternity</i>

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:20.910
<i>It will</i>

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:22.120
<i>Take you</i>

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:24.040
<i>Far away!</i>

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.080
<i>The eyes that peeked in</i>

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:30.120
<i>Shone with surprise</i>

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:36.250
<i>They make me feel like making them shine more</i>

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:39.330
<i>There's no way you won't reach</i>

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.330
<i>Come, try stretching out your hand</i>

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:44.290
<i>Once we're connected, I won't let you go</i>

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:45.370
<i>We won't be apart</i>

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.120
<i>The melody line I was looking for</i>

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.750
<i>The horns that all sounded at once</i>

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:54.120
<i>Bring color with a fanfare</i>

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:58.120
<i>The illusion is wrapped in color, calling</i>

00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:00.080
<i>"Come here"</i>

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:03.450
<i>Bring forth the moment you've been waiting for</i>

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:06.660
<i>That's right, the door just opened</i>

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:07.540
<i>I will</i>

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:08.700
<i>Take you</i>

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>With me</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:14.200
<i>Let's sing in an infinitely spreading harmony</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>Let our feelings join together</i>

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.200
<i>On the music staff</i>

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:23.040
<i>We follow</i> the parade

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:25.790
<i>With beautiful</i> sparkles

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:29.410
<i>Let's decorate</i> and paint that sky

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:30.540
<i>Amazing Grace</i>

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>Tell me what you wish for</i>

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:36.580
<i>I'll make that dream bloom</i>

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.790
<i>I'll make it come true</i>

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:42.450
<i>This fantasy</i>

00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:48.870
"Retrospective Special"
